}","__globals__":{"hint_label_color":"globals/colors?id=8920783","hint_label_typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=532e961","instance_background_color":"globals/colors?id=a5fd963","dots_style_color":"globals/colors?id=a5fd963","dots_style_hover_color":"globals/colors?id=primary","dots_style_active_color":"globals/colors?id=primary","dots_style_invert_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"},"offset":200,"instance_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"instance_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"sticky_offset":100,"instance_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"10000","right":"10000","bottom":"10000","left":"10000","isLinked":true},"dots_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"item_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"10","left":"0","isLinked":false},"hint_background_background":"classic","hint_background_color":"#02010100","hint_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"hint_icon_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"hint_label_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"hint_label_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"full_section_switch_on_mobile":"","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"%","size":0,"sizes":[]},"_css_classes":"scrolling-section","dots_style_hover_box_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"999","right":"999","bottom":"999","left":"999","isLinked":true},"sticky_on":["desktop","tablet"]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"jet-scroll-navigation"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"10b3cbdb","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":65},"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"right","width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":47},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"_flex_size":"none","_element_width_tablet":"initial"},"elements":[{"id":"720f1c3a","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"swiss health","width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"_element_id":"swiss"},"elements":[{"id":"35c6da07","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h5><strong>Tout sur l'assurance ménage en suisse</strong></h5><p class="p1">L'assurance inventaire de ménage en Suisse est une forme d'assurance qui offre une protection pour les biens personnels et les possessions à l'intérieur de votre domicile. Elle vise à couvrir les pertes ou les dommages causés par des événements tels que le vol, l'incendie, les dégâts d'eau ou d'autres catastrophes naturelles.</p>","_css_classes":"click-text","_element_id":"menage"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"7c23d8ae","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://le-comparateur-optimis.ch/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/theluckycharm_home_insurance_pictures_for_a_website_02f55ca3-a72c-4bda-8692-6f5b694561fb-min.png","id":3231,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"width":{"unit":"%","size":1000,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"30f3a693","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"how much","_element_id":"how-much"},"elements":[{"id":"3b58e2c8","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h5 class="p1"><b>Fonctionnement de l'assurance inventaire de ménage</b></h5><p class="p1">L'assurance inventaire de ménage fonctionne en vous permettant de déclarer la valeur de vos possessions personnelles et de souscrire une police d'assurance en conséquence. Vous devrez fournir une estimation de la valeur totale de vos biens, incluant les meubles, les appareils électroménagers, les vêtements, les bijoux, l'électronique, etc.</p>","_css_classes":"click-text","_element_id":"assurance-inventaire"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"502220ba","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"Swiss health","_element_id":"Swiss-health"},"elements":[{"id":"44f0810d","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h5 class="p1"><b>Assurance inventaire de ménage : Une police multirisque</b></h5><p class="p1">Une fois que vous avez souscrit une assurance inventaire de ménage, vos biens seront couverts en cas de vol, de dommages accidentels ou de destruction causée par des événements spécifiés dans votre police. La couverture peut varier en fonction de la compagnie d'assurance et de la police que vous choisissez.</p><p class="p1">Il est important de noter que l'assurance inventaire de ménage ne couvre généralement pas les biens professionnels ou commerciaux, les véhicules à moteur, les animaux domestiques ou les objets de grande valeur tels que les œuvres d'art ou les objets de collection. Pour ces biens spécifiques, vous pourriez avoir besoin d'une assurance supplémentaire.</p>","_css_classes":"click-text","_element_id":"assurance-police"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"7b6cd4e","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://le-comparateur-optimis.ch/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/theluckycharm_home_insurance_pictures_for_a_website_6ad4b54b-855f-48b5-8f5b-cb0a319d3687-min.png","id":3232,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"width":{"unit":"%","size":1000,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"},{"id":"6e7fab60","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h5 class="p1"><b>optimis vous aide à y voir plus clair</b></h5><p class="p1">En cas de sinistre, vous devrez généralement déclarer l'incident à votre compagnie d'assurance dès que possible. Vous devrez fournir des preuves de propriété, telles que des factures d'achat, des photos ou une liste détaillée des biens endommagés ou volés. Votre compagnie d'assurance évaluera ensuite la réclamation et vous indemnisera en fonction de la valeur des biens perdus ou endommagés, moins toute franchise applicable.</p><p class="p1">Il est recommandé de tenir un inventaire à jour de vos biens pour faciliter le processus de réclamation en cas de perte. Vous pouvez conserver les factures d'achat, prendre des photos de vos possessions et les garder en lieu sûr, ou utiliser des applications mobiles spécialement conçues pour l'inventaire de ménage.</p>","_css_classes":"click-text","_element_id":"plus-clair"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"fe73f06","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"Tools","_element_id":"Tools"},"elements":[{"id":"126e79a7","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://le-comparateur-optimis.ch/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/La-date-limite-de-changement-est-depassee-que-faire-1.jpg","id":3014,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"width":{"unit":"%","size":1000,"sizes":[]},"link_to":"custom"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"4c7925e0","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"Comparative","_element_id":"Comparative"},"elements":[{"id":"68d7acf8","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"","_css_classes":"click-text"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"25880aff","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"","_css_classes":"click-text"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"f99511d","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"Health insurance 2","_element_id":"Health-insurance-2"},"elements":[{"id":"6e7183be","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"","_css_classes":"click-text"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"2414454d","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"","_css_classes":"click-text"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ba85492","elType":"container","settings":{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[],"_title":"importance","_element_id":"imp